1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
A working hook does three jobs in under one second. Miss one, the scroll wins.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Job one: something moves. Not a logo fading in — a human, an object, a frame change. Motion is the only thing peripheral vision respects.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Job two: a claim lands. On screen, not just spoken — half your viewers have sound off. Six words or fewer, readable at arm’s length.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Job three: a face, if you have one. Eyes with intent, mid-expression — not composed and waiting. We are wired to check faces first.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Move, claim, face — inside zero point eight. Save this and check your last three hooks against it. The checklist version’s on screen now.

